OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fand rather cloudy, but with the cloud
OL,7,Fthinning and breaking at times
OL,8,Fparticularly in the Southwest. A
OL,9,Flittle patchy rain could push into
OL,10,FDumfries and Galloway later in the
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FMainly dry in the east,
OL,14,Fcloudy to start but some bright spells
OL,15,Fin the afternoon. Generally brighter
OL,16,Fin the Southwest but with some heavy
OL,17,Fshowers in the afternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
